Source: dbc-dxfs
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DBC DXFS Maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/kdegeek/DBC_DXFS

Package: dbc-dxfs-dccapp-runner
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, xdg-utils, bash
Description: DB/C DX .dccapp runner and desktop integration
 Provides a DCCAPL-compatible launcher that reads .dccapp files and invokes
 the DB/C DX runtime on Linux. All sensitive endpoints and credentials are
 read from the .dccapp at runtime (not stored in the package).
